source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-23
observed: The brace form `{*}` opens and closes a bold effect between word runes, which the bare `*` cannot.
-- input.jira --
a{*}b{*}c
-- rendered.html --
<p>a<b>b</b>c</p>
-- want.md --
a**b**c
-- warnings.json --
[]
